  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The formula to calculate the dipole moment is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8640;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8640;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) to calculate the dipole moment.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8640;</mo></mover></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the torque on the dipole in the electric field is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (2) to calculate the required torque.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8640;</mo></mover></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dyne</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>dyne</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
